Preconditions: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{
\textbf{PRE-1} The user is authenticated and has the Admin role. \newline
\textbf{PRE-2} The post or comment exists in the trash (has been soft-deleted or rejected).
} \\ \hline

